# GEMINI.md (example router — PROJECT level)

> Copy this to `<project>/GEMINI.md`. Thin router for Gemini CLI + Google Antigravity.

Gemini CLI / Antigravity: read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) first. That file is the project dispatcher.

Follow its bootstrap directive (section 0) before any task.

This file exists because Antigravity's file-precedence prefers `GEMINI.md`. All logic lives in `AGENTS.md`.
